\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>, and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">this<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>valid<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> returns the same value as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other.<span class=\"me1\">valid</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> would have returned before the construction.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another future object to initialize with\n</td></tr></table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library (since C++11)"},{"path":"thread/shared_future","title":"std::shared_future"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::shared_future<T>::shared_future","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"5 declarations; revisions: since C++11, until C++17, since C++17. Constructs a new shared_future."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"}]},"standards":["C++11","C++17"],"wordCount":118,"codeBlockCount":0}
